# Binary proof artifacts. If Git LFS is enabled for this repository, uncomment the
# filter lines below (and run `git lfs migrate import --include="docs/print-proof/**"`
# in a coordinated history rewrite) so clones stop downloading ~33 MB of proofs.
docs/print-proof/**/*.pdf  binary
docs/print-proof/**/*.png  binary
docs/print-proof/**/*.xlsx binary
